Subject: CPMS I03E3 Proof Oracle and Review Protocol Justification

@ [justification_uuid] a73410fc-4693-4aed-a248-7f90e352ac61
@ [canonical_specification_uuid] e0eb5b94-0229-47f3-aa4e-70e3f1136f19

& [Problem] generated cases can self-confirm when the generator writes expectations the implementation supplies truth or faculty receipts mutually depend on their own future digests
& [Rejected1] copy actual output into expectation because it launders implementation behavior into oracle authority
& [Rejected2] use one matching reader boolean as review because claim meaning and expectation remain untested
& [Rejected3] call hashes CRCs or attestations digital signatures because trust identity would be false
& [Rejected4] make Honesty and Security receipts directly mutually self-referential because digest construction becomes circular
& [Rejected5] sample a batch and admit all members because unreviewed cases gain invisible authority
& [Rejected6] delete dissent after correction because reasoning lineage and fault evidence disappear
& [Selected] independent stage oracles exact receipts trust-bound principals two primary reviews two cross acknowledgments one envelope durable dissent and total Observer accounting
& [Reason] the selected protocol makes trust and disagreement inspectable without conflating review completion with execution or authority admission
& [Disposition] is formation_justified_receipt_issuance_not_justified
